  id: 06819c42-9b45-4feb-969d-5ab2f6da161a
  Action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 753df31ef07ffaf47adadc6626322adb, type: 2}
  state: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 753df31ef07ffaf47adadc6626322adb, type: 2}
  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "\r\"At 03.46 we received an S.O.S MIKE, so me and the missus went to help
    but when we arrived there were no car nor tricycle. \n<link>A huge cow-thing</link>
    was taking <link>a driver</link> out of a <link>truck</link>. There was this
    glow at the back, see? We tried to get a better look but it started flushing
    green stuff everywhere! \nThat\u2019s when we heard the roar. My <link>Mora</link>
    still has the heebie-jeebies. She saw. There were two. \r\nEver been chased by
    a <link>9-foot tall cow</link> and its <link>intergalactic friend</link> down
    the <link>road</link> in the middle of the night? Excuse us for not stopping
    to take pictures! \r\nIt took South... Maybe it was looking to rest after it
    ate the cow. Like in <link>those woods</link> near <link>Whoopla</link> .\" "
